# Never bake real channel analytics into a publicly-pushed image -- see the
# matching note in .gitignore. Belt and braces: .gitignore keeps these out of
# the repo, this keeps them out of the image even when building from a dirty
# working tree.
Content */
Geography */
Traffic source */
*.csv
Screenshot *.png
screenshots

